* datadict.dts
* Canonical DotTalk++ data dictionary lane opener.
*
* Purpose:
*   - activate the datadict paths
*   - load the canonical ddbase workspace
*   - expose the DD* tables for inspection and runtime DDICT work

DO ddbase
WORKSPACE LOAD ddbase

ECHO ===== DATADICT TOOLING READY =====
ECHO Data dictionary workspace is active.
ECHO Canonical workspace: ddbase.dtschema
ECHO DDICT helper/demo script: DDICT_HELP.dts
ECHO ==================================
